<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>AI 알고리즘 트레이딩 강의 핸드북 — 전체 목차</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ css_path }}">
<style>
{{ inline_css }}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
  <!-- Top Navigation Header with Embedded Base64 Logo -->
  <header class="top-nav">
    <a class="brand" href="{{ index_filename|default('00_AI트레이딩_전체교재_목차.html') }}">
      <img src="{{ logo_data_uri }}" alt="DATATRAIN Logo">
      <span>DATATRAIN</span>
    </a>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <span class="crumb">{{ total_clips }}개 클립 · 약 {{ "%.1f"|format(total_minutes / 60) }}시간 분량</span>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Index Header (GDPval Style) -->
  <div class="index-header">
    <h1>코딩 몰라도 완성하는<br>나만의 AI 알고리즘 트레이딩 시스템</h1>
    <p><strong>w. Claude Code</strong> — 5개 파트 · 17개 챕터 · {{ total_clips }}개 클립 · 실습 23개 · 프로젝트 3개</p>
    <p style="font-size: 14.5px; color: #64748b; margin-top: 6px;">
      💡 <strong>학습 가이드</strong>: 모니터 좌측에 이 웹 교재를 띄우고, 우측에 Claude Code를 띄워 실시간으로 함께 실습하세요.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Part & Clip List -->
  {% for part in parts %}
  <section class="part-section">
    <div class="part-section-header">
      <h2>Part {{ "%02d"|format(part.number) }}. {{ part.title }}</h2>
      <span class="meta">{{ part.clip_count }}클립 · {{ part.minutes }}분</span>
    </div>
    
    {% for chapter in part.chapters %}
    <div class="chapter-group">
      <div class="chapter-title">CH{{ "%02d"|format(chapter.number) }}. {{ chapter.title }}</div>
      <ul class="clip-list">
        {% for clip in chapter.clips %}
        <li class="clip-item">
          <a href="{{ clip.href }}">
            <span class="clip-id">Clip {{ "%02d"|format(clip.clip_num) }}</span>
            <span class="clip-title">{{ clip.title }}</span>
            {% if clip.practice %}
            <span class="mini-tag prac">{{ clip.practice }}</span>
            {% endif %}
            <span class="mini-tag time">{{ clip.duration }}분</span>
          </a>
        </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </section>
  {% endfor %}

  <!-- Footer -->
  <footer class="site-footer">
    <span>© DATATRAIN. All rights reserved.</span>
    <span>본 교육 콘텐츠의 무단 복제 및 상업적 재배포를 금합니다.</span>
  </footer>
</div>
</body>
</html>
